# Vitest Testing Standard (HW3)

Scoped to NestJS/Angular implementation under `homework-3/platform/`.

1. All newly created test files must use **Vitest**.
2. Any modified existing tests must be migrated to Vitest in the same change when practical.
3. Do not use Node test runner APIs such as `node:test` or `node:assert` in tests.
4. Prefer importing test functions and assertions from `vitest`.
5. Use the project test script for verification so tests run through the Vitest setup.
6. Map tests to [`docs/testing/testing-strategy.md`](../../docs/testing/testing-strategy.md) and Mars Family fixtures in [`mocks/`](../../mocks/).
7. For NestJS BFF/services: prefer `app.request()` integration tests where applicable; see [`homework-3/.cursor/skills/vitest-testing/SKILL.md`](../skills/vitest-testing/SKILL.md).
